## Extending the System

### Adding New Qualifiers

```python
# Add custom qualifier templates
custom_qualifiers = [
    ComparisonPred(">=", "ν", "0"),      # Non-negative
    ComparisonPred("<", "ν", "len"),     # Array bounds
    ComparisonPred("==", "ν", "x + y"),  # Arithmetic relationships
]
```

### Adding New Expression Types

1. Add AST node in `expressions.py`
2. Handle in `ConstraintGenerator.generate()`
3. Handle in `infer()` in `inference.py`

## Limitations & Future Work

- [ ] Support for algebraic data types (sum types, records)
- [ ] Dependent function types (refinement on function arguments)
- [ ] Measure functions for recursive data structures
- [ ] Integration with Python's typing module (`typing.Annotated`)
- [ ] More sophisticated qualifier synthesis (abduction)
- [ ] Error messages with source locations

